X:1
T:Who Wants to Live Forever
C:Queen (Brian May)
N:From a sequenced MIDI vocal line (hamienet.com). Written 6 semitones above the source (A major to E-flat) to fit C4-A5. Re-attacks of held notes were merged, a sixteenth-note flourish near the end of the chorus was dropped (it would go above A5), and the second verse and outro are left out. One pass is verse plus chorus; the final 2-beat bar pays back the 2-beat pickup so it loops.
